# DeepSeek Workflow 独立仓库忽略规则（Deepseek-Workflow = deepseek-desktop 文件夹）。
# 进入 harness checkout 后与 harness 根 .gitignore 叠加生效。
node_modules/
lib/
# The shipped custom plugin's lib/ is hand-written runtime source (not a
# build artifact) and MUST be tracked — re-include it after the lib/ rule.
!plugins/dsh-client-ui-desktop-plugins/lib/
!plugins/dsh-client-ui-desktop-plugins/lib/*
dist/
deploy/
deploy-stale-*/
build/
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
# plugins.json ships the default enablement (the desktop plugin manager tab);
# user-local enable/disable edits show up as normal diffs. The generated
# composition overlay stays user-local: it is rebuilt from the registry on
# every launch.
plugins/desktop-plugins.generated.patch.yml
.iconcheck/
